{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38864","headline":"夏日登友人书斋林亭 · 杜荀鹤","name":"夏日登友人书斋林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暑天长似秋天冷，带郭林亭画不如。\n蝉噪槛前遮日竹，鹭窥池面弄萍鱼。\n抛山野客横琴醉，种药家僮踏雪锄。\n衆惜君才堪上第，莫因居此与名疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38864.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38864","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}